    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... it feels like the world is moving on without any meaning. everything feels so hollow and empty like i'm just a ghost in my own life. does it even matter if i'm still here? everything i loved is gone and it feels like there's nothing left to hold onto.",
